Changes:
 compiz (1:0.9.14.2+25.10.20250930-0ubuntu3+unity3) resolute; urgency=medium
 .
   * compizconfig: close the plugin metadata cache file and the saved ini
     file once. The second close could close a file another thread had just
     opened, which made unity-active-plugins-safety-check abort at login and
     ended the Unity session.
   * compizconfig: do not read the completed upgrades file when its size
     cannot be measured; skip the upgrade check instead of aborting.
   * compizconfig: tests for both.
